Why this architecture?

A large farm needs clear separation between its business operations, customer experience, and AI processing. It also avoids making the entire platform dependent on a single AI provider.
B. Application architecture
I recommend starting with a modular monolith, not dozens of microservices.

This means one main backend application containing separate business modules, with clear boundaries between them.
