C. Mobile application architecture
Since you want all three platforms, I recommend:
Platform	Main users	Main functionality
Website	Customers and businesses	Browse, order, contact
Admin web dashboard	Owner and management	Complete farm management
Farm mobile app	Employees and managers	Daily operations
Customer mobile app	Retail customers	Shopping and delivery tracking
Business portal	Wholesale customers	Bulk ordering and invoices

The mobile apps should use the same backend and business rules as the website.

For the first launch, a responsive website and PWA can provide an economical way to validate mobile workflows before investing in two native applications.

